text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2DA5 {
    "Did the currents carry you here, too?\nThis must have been fated. Let’s battle!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2DF4 {
    "Strong!\nToo much so!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2E09 {
    "It’s just my luck that a tough TRAINER\nlike you would drift here...\lI must be cursed..."
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2E61 {
    "I’ve led a life of woe and misery...\nI’ve been cast away, and this is where\lI’ve drifted..."
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2EBD {
    "Another loss..."
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2ECD {
    "A life adrift...\nI don’t want it anymore!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2EF7 {
    "Welcome!\nI’ve been expecting you!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2F19 {
    "No! Please!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2F25 {
    "A strong child TRAINER...\nThat’s so annoying!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2F53 {
    "I want to win like everyone else, but I\nwon’t raise POKéMON like everyone else."
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2FA3 {
    "Darn it!\nMy way is still too slack!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C2FC7 {
    "It’s way more fun to do things the way\nI want than to be like everybody else.\lI mean, that’s obvious!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C302D {
    "I came all the way out here with my\nBIRD POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C305F {
    "You...\nYou’re stunningly cool!"
}

text Naranja_Route133_G00_M48_Text_081C307E {
    "I’d like to go back to FORTREE, but I’ve\ngrown to like this place, too."
}
